[{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10228002_00_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10228002_00_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10228002_00_0020","text":"──嗯？阳希\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10228002_00_0030","text":"……！\n那个……嗯…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10228002_00_0040","text":"哈哈。当然，没忘啊\n阳希，生日快乐！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s61_10228002_00_0050","text":"真是的。刚才是故意的吗～？\n呵呵～，谢谢你……！"}]
